dominant.\"","j":9,"h":17,"s":7,"a":113,"sd":null},{"k":"7:114","t":"He said, \"Yes, and, [moreover], you will be among those made near [to me].\"","j":9,"h":17,"s":7,"a":114,"sd":null},{"k":"7:115","t":"They said, \"O Moses, either you throw [your staff], or we will be the ones to throw [first].\"","j":9,"h":17,"s":7,"a":115,"sd":null},{"k":"7:116","t":"He said, \"Throw,\" and when they threw, they bewitched the eyes of the people and struck terror into them, and they presented a great [feat of] magic.","j":9,"h":17,"s":7,"a":116,"sd":null},{"k":"7:117","t":"And We inspired to Moses, \"Throw your staff,\" and at once it devoured what they were falsifying.","j":9,"h":17,"s":7,"a":117,"sd":null},{"k":"7:118","t":"So the truth was established, and abolished was what they were doing.","j":9,"h":17,"s":7,"a":118,"sd":null},{"k":"7:119","t":"And they [i.e., Pharaoh and his people] were overcome right there and became debased.","j":9,"h":17,"s":7,"a":119,"sd":null},{"k":"7:120","t":"And the magicians fell down in prostration [to Allāh].","j":9,"h":17,"s":7,"a":120,"sd":null}],"juz":9,"hizb":17,"surahs":[7],"sajdah":false}